    "flavor_text_entries": [
      {
        "flavor_text": "トップを　めざすはずが　ゆきやまに まよいのぼり　さむさに　たえるうちに けが　はえてきて　しんかしていた。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja-Hrkt",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/1/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/27/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Il rêvait d’atteindre le sommet d’un pic enneigé, mais s’est égaré en chemin. Il a dû évoluer pour survivre au froid et a acquis un pelage fourni.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/27/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "It aimed for the top but got lost and ended up on a snowy mountain. Being forced to endure the cold, this Pokémon evolved and grew fur.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/27/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "トップを　目指すはずが　雪山に 迷い登り　寒さに　耐えるうちに 毛が　生えてきて　進化していた。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/27/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "とにかく　みさかいなく　なぐる。 いざと　なったら　ハサミを　じせつし ロケットのように　はっしゃし　なぐる。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja-Hrkt",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/1/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/28/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Il distribue les coups de pince au petit bonheur la chance. En dernier recours, il les décroche et les envoie telles des roquettes.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/28/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "It just throws punches indiscriminately. In times of desperation, it can lop off its own pincers and fire them like rockets.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/28/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "とにかく　見境なく　なぐる。 いざと　なったら　ハサミを　自切し ロケットのように　発射し　なぐる。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/28/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "ハサミの　なかに　れいきを　ためて ぶんなぐる。　ぶあつい　こおりの かべも　こなごなに　してしまうぞ。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja-Hrkt",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/1/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/29/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Il concentre le froid dans ses pinces avant de frapper. Ses coups sont suffisamment puissants pour réduire un épais mur de glace en morceaux.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/29/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "It stores coldness in its pincers and pummels its foes. It can even smash thick walls of ice to bits!",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/29/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "ハサミの　中に　冷気を　溜めて ぶん殴る。　分厚い　氷の 壁も　粉々に　してしまうぞ。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/29/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "かんがえるより　まず　なぐってみる。 ゆきなだれを　パンチの　ラッシュで おしかえしたという　きろくも　ある。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja-Hrkt",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/1/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/30/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Agir ou réfléchir ? Crabominable choisit de frapper ! On raconte qu’il serait déjà parvenu à repousser une avalanche à coups de pince.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/30/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Before it stops to think, it just starts pummeling. There are records of its turning back avalanches with a flurry of punches.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/30/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "考えるより　まず　殴ってみる。 ゆきなだれを　パンチの　ラッシュで 押し返したという　記録も　ある。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/30/"
        }
      }
    ]
  }
